                                "sense_id": "9e5eddb7-a113-3b19-b799-b7b1bf8461de",
                                "text": "While at school, he worked in […] the disgusting slush of Boston’s outer suburbs. He got accustomed to driving all day to a job site, working, and then driving the winding roads and blind curves to Somerville, only to wake up and do it again the next morning."
